Usage: pms2dot [OPTIONS]

Option values use --name=value.

Options:
  --help                                      Print this message
  --version                                   Print the program version
  --check-order                               Reject branches outside bitstring-vector order
  --reorder                                   Sort branches into bitstring-vector order
Read progress measures ending with | from standard input.
Each measure is a comma-separated vector of bitstrings.
Default: preserve input order. --check-order and --reorder are exclusive.
Bitstrings use infinite-binary-tree DFS order (0 beta < e < 1 beta);
vectors are compared lexicographically.
